{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "82065861-d6d0-81cb-9299-2d2f581f682c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T13:21:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rafael Rivera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:19:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, madam. Thank you for answering. My name is Rafael Rivera. I am calling about a storm drain, please, in front of my property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Mr. Rivera. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 311 Old Beach Road, on the Easton's Beach side. I am the landlord of the house there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:19:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 311 Old Beach Road. And what's the drain doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:19:29-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is making a, how do I say, a grunting sound. Very slow. The water does not go down. When there is a thaw, the snow melts and then it backs up into the street. And there is no storm now, you understand, the weather is dry. Only the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:19:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So it's slow and backing up with the melt, even without any storm. Is the water getting onto the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, the road. The cars are slowing down to a crawl to pass through it. I am worried someone will have an accident, or the water will come to the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:20:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense to worry. Let me write that down. Slow drain, backs up on thaw, traffic crawling through at 311 Old Beach Road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:20:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, thank you. Please, can you tell me when they last came to look at this drain? Do you have the record of the cleaning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:20:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I ask because I have put a timer on my phone to remind me to check it, and it keeps going off. Every few hours. [pause] Excuse me, it is ringing now. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:20:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:20:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am sorry. It is off now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:20:43-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. I can't see the last cleaning date from my screen here. I'll put the request in for a crew to go out and look at it, and I'll note that you're asking about the last visit so the supervisor can answer that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:20:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is very kind. You will call me back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:21:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can have someone do that. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:21:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:21:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0194, Rafael Rivera, 311 Old Beach Road. Did I say that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:21:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, perfect. Thank you very much, madam. I appreciate your patience with my English."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:21:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your English is fine. We'll be in touch. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:21:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, madam. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
